(6973016, 1052628, 62318, '<td valign="top">Okay, you are the last image. That was the most painful voting process I have went through in a long time. At least this image has some semblance of wind.<br/> <br/>It''s actually not a bad shot. I am glad I landed on it last (not necessarily the best, but convincing).  Good expression, and that hair, it is really going places. I like the pink with the green tint. But not the fact of the cut off hand... oh well. It''s a good shot. 7 (though normally a 6 I would say, but I am jaded now after voting).<br/> <br/>Thank you so much for ending this voting nightmare on a semi high note.</td>', 'Okay, you are the last image. That was the most painful voting process I have went through in a long time. At least this image has some semblance of wind. It''s actually not a bad shot. I am glad I landed on it last (not necessarily the best, but convincing).  Good expression, and that hair, it is really going places. I like the pink with the green tint. But not the fact of the cut off hand... oh well. It''s a good shot. 7 (though normally a 6 I would say, but I am jaded now after voting). Thank you so much for ending this voting nightmare on a semi high note.', '2013-02-06 01:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973022, 1052812, 62318, '<td valign="top">There are about four images that should place.<br/>This is one of them.<br/>Good back ground<br/>Good light.<br/>Good wind.<br/> <br/>Just wish there was more engagement with the subject and the viewer...<br/>It''s a bit too casual for me.<br/> <br/>However, given the field of entries this is miles above most. 9. <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'There are about four images that should place.This is one of them.Good back groundGood light.Good wind. Just wish there was more engagement with the subject and the viewer...It''s a bit too casual for me. However, given the field of entries this is miles above most. 9. Good luck.', '2013-02-06 01:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973023, 1052717, 62318, '<td valign="top">You know, you have a good image here.<br/>Good dark and white balance.<br/>Good shapes.<br/>It keeps the viewer engaged.<br/>The slight tilt... not too sure, but I will go with it.<br/> <br/>Wind, prominent. So it is a winner here.</td>', 'You know, you have a good image here.Good dark and white balance.Good shapes.It keeps the viewer engaged.The slight tilt... not too sure, but I will go with it. Wind, prominent. So it is a winner here.', '2013-02-06 01:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973024, 1051945, 62318, '<td valign="top">Honestly due to the processing I can''t tell if this is Wind or if this is just soft edges. You took the detail out of the hair, so it doesn''t mean much to the challenge.<br/> <br/>As for the photo itself. I do like the processing. I think the eye contact with the viewer is spot on. I also like the purple with the green. This all makes for a very ''magical'' photo. I think you did good work here.</td>', 'Honestly due to the processing I can''t tell if this is Wind or if this is just soft edges. You took the detail out of the hair, so it doesn''t mean much to the challenge. As for the photo itself. I do like the processing. I think the eye contact with the viewer is spot on. I also like the purple with the green. This all makes for a very ''magical'' photo. I think you did good work here.', '2013-02-06 01:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
