(6973351, 1052810, 44765, '<td valign="top">10-  This is what I had in  mind for this challenge. You have done it perfectly. Simple and the breeze can definitely be felt. I gave up miserably after so many tries. I would appreciate it If you could tell me how you set up for this when you get a chance.</td>', '10-  This is what I had in  mind for this challenge. You have done it perfectly. Simple and the breeze can definitely be felt. I gave up miserably after so many tries. I would appreciate it If you could tell me how you set up for this when you get a chance.', '2013-02-06 11:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973363, 1052632, 62318, '<td valign="top">One of the best shots of the group. You captured the essence of win here, but you also captured the eye of the viewer. I might have gone with a different toning myself, but nothing wrong with the way it is. I like how the trees and fence round on the compositional elements. Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'One of the best shots of the group. You captured the essence of win here, but you also captured the eye of the viewer. I might have gone with a different toning myself, but nothing wrong with the way it is. I like how the trees and fence round on the compositional elements. Hope it does well for you.', '2013-02-06 11:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
