(6973405, 1052338, 62318, '<td valign="top">Frozen breeze? Is that like non-flowing river? <br/> <br/>I do see little tufts up there. But is that wind or evaporation? I can''t tell. The viewer shouldn''t have to guess.<br/> <br/>As for the shot itself. I really enjoy the three tones you have here: blue, white, and brown. Nice, good detail in the snow. You can briefly see that trail/road line going across, very neat. Good forward-presence landscape.</td>', 'Frozen breeze? Is that like non-flowing river?  I do see little tufts up there. But is that wind or evaporation? I can''t tell. The viewer shouldn''t have to guess. As for the shot itself. I really enjoy the three tones you have here: blue, white, and brown. Nice, good detail in the snow. You can briefly see that trail/road line going across, very neat. Good forward-presence landscape.', '2013-02-06 12:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973406, 1052749, 62318, '<td valign="top">I missed the wind? Where is it? The lake looks pretty still to me?<br/> <br/>As for the landscape itself. It has a good mirrored reflection, good detail in the foreground and the colors are nice and warm. It is a very scenic shot, you should be happy with the result. Wish I could be there.</td>', 'I missed the wind? Where is it? The lake looks pretty still to me? As for the landscape itself. It has a good mirrored reflection, good detail in the foreground and the colors are nice and warm. It is a very scenic shot, you should be happy with the result. Wish I could be there.', '2013-02-06 12:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
