(6973737, 1052377, 123348, '<td valign="top">awesome, awesome picture, however where is the wind? I will have to think about this one before voting. Wished you would have used this one for free study, definitely front page material!<br/> <br/>OK, so I took a day to think about this. I love this image and never mind the absence of wind, it is a 10 in composition and lighting and that is what I will give it.(besides, maybe the plane implies wind somehow) 10 it is</td>', 'awesome, awesome picture, however where is the wind? I will have to think about this one before voting. Wished you would have used this one for free study, definitely front page material! OK, so I took a day to think about this. I love this image and never mind the absence of wind, it is a 10 in composition and lighting and that is what I will give it.(besides, maybe the plane implies wind somehow) 10 it is', '2013-02-06 18:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
