(6974039, 1052813, 47316, '<td valign="top">Holy awesome capture! Not crazy about the negative space but then again it''s hard to say as I can''t see the whole shot at once on my screen. Curious to see a closer version of this.</td>', 'Holy awesome capture! Not crazy about the negative space but then again it''s hard to say as I can''t see the whole shot at once on my screen. Curious to see a closer version of this.', '2013-02-07 02:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974041, 1052739, 47316, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, cute pup!</td>', 'Nice tones, cute pup!', '2013-02-07 02:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974045, 1052767, 47316, '<td valign="top">This had the makings of a lovely shot however the lighting just isn''t right and the make-up and post processing on her face are just too much. Let her be the natural beauty she is!</td>', 'This had the makings of a lovely shot however the lighting just isn''t right and the make-up and post processing on her face are just too much. Let her be the natural beauty she is!', '2013-02-07 02:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974048, 1052437, 47316, '<td valign="top">I think it might look nicer cropped higher, the tile and grates add nothing to the shot. The clouds and water are quite lovely.</td>', 'I think it might look nicer cropped higher, the tile and grates add nothing to the shot. The clouds and water are quite lovely.', '2013-02-07 02:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974050, 1052610, 47316, '<td valign="top">Practically perfect in every way. I''m not sure why Poppins popped in my head, just a whimsical sort of photo I guess. :)</td>', 'Practically perfect in every way. I''m not sure why Poppins popped in my head, just a whimsical sort of photo I guess. :)', '2013-02-07 02:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974054, 1052759, 135744, '<td valign="top">Superb shot! It looks cold up there on the moors. Wondered if horizon would have been better straight but think it works fine as it is and not one for having to follow rules. May be just the incline of the land anyway.</td>', 'Superb shot! It looks cold up there on the moors. Wondered if horizon would have been better straight but think it works fine as it is and not one for having to follow rules. May be just the incline of the land anyway.', '2013-02-07 02:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974055, 1051945, 47316, '<td valign="top">Love the processing and expression. Different.</td>', 'Love the processing and expression. Different.', '2013-02-07 02:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974057, 1052810, 47316, '<td valign="top">This has a nice soft feel to it. Wondering why the couch isn''t cropped out, I don''t think it adds to the photo and the composition would be nicer without it too.</td>', 'This has a nice soft feel to it. Wondering why the couch isn''t cropped out, I don''t think it adds to the photo and the composition would be nicer without it too.', '2013-02-07 02:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974059, 1052739, 49109, '<td valign="top">Nicely detailed, wonderful tones. He seems to have fun!<br/>PS: I guess this is Gap.</td>', 'Nicely detailed, wonderful tones. He seems to have fun!PS: I guess this is Gap.', '2013-02-07 02:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974060, 1052624, 49109, '<td valign="top">A tad on the dark side</td>', 'A tad on the dark side', '2013-02-07 02:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974063, 1052703, 49109, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t convey wind; out of focus, grainy, overprocessed - you probably like it but it''s not my cuppa tea</td>', 'Doesn''t convey wind; out of focus, grainy, overprocessed - you probably like it but it''s not my cuppa tea', '2013-02-07 02:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974069, 1052810, 137576, '<td valign="top">i gave this a 4, the glow or the blur really isnt to my liking, theres only a slight hind of wind and it holds no interest to me, the back of a young mans legs thats it, whys he there whats he looking for, i need my thoughts provoking and theres no detail to entice me, nothing to look at, i can take the entire pic in in seconds.</td>', 'i gave this a 4, the glow or the blur really isnt to my liking, theres only a slight hind of wind and it holds no interest to me, the back of a young mans legs thats it, whys he there whats he looking for, i need my thoughts provoking and theres no detail to entice me, nothing to look at, i can take the entire pic in in seconds.', '2013-02-07 03:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974095, 1052810, 118154, '<td valign="top">Nice image,although sort of indoors still fits.Processing just about right for me.</td>', 'Nice image,although sort of indoors still fits.Processing just about right for me.', '2013-02-07 06:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974097, 1052739, 118154, '<td valign="top">Bit horny but who can resist this wonderful image.</td>', 'Bit horny but who can resist this wonderful image.', '2013-02-07 06:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974112, 1052749, 100495, '<td valign="top">To me this says stillness, calm etc.</td>', 'To me this says stillness, calm etc.', '2013-02-07 07:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974113, 1052657, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonal but the reflections are quite distracting</td>', 'Nice diagonal but the reflections are quite distracting', '2013-02-07 07:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974117, 1052778, 153814, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of these old squaw you have alot here.<br/>Females, males, diving, look outs, and a beautiful breaking wave.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot of these old squaw you have alot here.Females, males, diving, look outs, and a beautiful breaking wave.Well done.', '2013-02-07 07:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974168, 1052571, 144365, '<td valign="top">DNMC!<br/>Had to add this after your comment in the forum thread.<br/> <br/>edit - I don''t actually think this is DNMC, but thought it''d be funny to say so.</td>', 'DNMC!Had to add this after your comment in the forum thread. edit - I don''t actually think this is DNMC, but thought it''d be funny to say so.', '2013-02-07 10:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974201, 1052632, 82999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  Love the processing of it as well.  Very comforting. My only 10.</td>', 'Wonderful.  Love the processing of it as well.  Very comforting. My only 10.', '2013-02-07 10:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974203, 1052739, 82999, '<td valign="top">Your BW processing is outstanding.   The subtle changes in tone really work.  And Weimaraners rock.  The only thing that bothers me about this image is the effect of the wind is a bit too subtle.  Either way, I like the shot.  Could even see hanging it.</td>', 'Your BW processing is outstanding.   The subtle changes in tone really work.  And Weimaraners rock.  The only thing that bothers me about this image is the effect of the wind is a bit too subtle.  Either way, I like the shot.  Could even see hanging it.', '2013-02-07 10:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974205, 1052726, 82999, '<td valign="top">The sky is a bit too dark, but not enough to take away form the shot for me.  What does though is the fabric.   I think the lines are too sharp almost looks like paper or that it was cut.  Would have preferred something else with smooth lines and a softer feel to compliment the warmth of the sun.  Still though, I gave it an 8.  It''s sort of a near miss for me.  A truly nice shot that I feel could have been over the top.</td>', 'The sky is a bit too dark, but not enough to take away form the shot for me.  What does though is the fabric.   I think the lines are too sharp almost looks like paper or that it was cut.  Would have preferred something else with smooth lines and a softer feel to compliment the warmth of the sun.  Still though, I gave it an 8.  It''s sort of a near miss for me.  A truly nice shot that I feel could have been over the top.', '2013-02-07 10:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974206, 1052759, 82999, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Don''t think it needed the off kilter angle. It''s dramatic enough without it.  I also would have liked to seen it without the vignett, the sheep are strong enough that they really don''t need anything to draw your attention to them.  For me it, the vignette sort of pulls my eye away from their condition.  It''s a very nice shot though.</td>', 'Love it.  Don''t think it needed the off kilter angle. It''s dramatic enough without it.  I also would have liked to seen it without the vignett, the sheep are strong enough that they really don''t need anything to draw your attention to them.  For me it, the vignette sort of pulls my eye away from their condition.  It''s a very nice shot though.', '2013-02-07 10:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974207, 1052735, 82999, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative.  Cute, works all around for me.  Might have gone for something else than the cloth at the bottom, but its definitely a fun piece.</td>', 'Very imaginative.  Cute, works all around for me.  Might have gone for something else than the cloth at the bottom, but its definitely a fun piece.', '2013-02-07 10:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974219, 1052767, 82999, '<td valign="top">It looks over processed to me.  I would have preferred to see if without the skin softening, looks too saturated as well around the eyes and mouth.  The strong vignette on the left side is to strong.  Feel it would have been better as open space.  If the vignette was done to pull the eye to the fan, I question whether that was really needed.  The fan is pretty cool as is, original as well.  Might have been better just to crop it tighter on the left side and remove the vignette altogether.  <br/> <br/>All that said, I really like this image for what I think it could be as opposed to what it is at the moment.  I think its a shot I''d definitely  revisit.</td>', 'It looks over processed to me.  I would have preferred to see if without the skin softening, looks too saturated as well around the eyes and mouth.  The strong vignette on the left side is to strong.  Feel it would have been better as open space.  If the vignette was done to pull the eye to the fan, I question whether that was really needed.  The fan is pretty cool as is, original as well.  Might have been better just to crop it tighter on the left side and remove the vignette altogether.   All that said, I really like this image for what I think it could be as opposed to what it is at the moment.  I think its a shot I''d definitely  revisit.', '2013-02-07 10:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974310, 1052811, 54446, '<td valign="top">Should be a ribbon contender.  Great capture of the wind blow wave crests.  I think my favorite part of the image is the rich sand color/texture, the wonderful green of the foreground waves.  I much admire your choice of low sun and angle to subject.  Thanks for squaring that horizon.  Glorious gradient to the dark blue sky.  I think this is a magnificent seascape.   And, great title.  This one has it all.   10</td>', 'Should be a ribbon contender.  Great capture of the wind blow wave crests.  I think my favorite part of the image is the rich sand color/texture, the wonderful green of the foreground waves.  I much admire your choice of low sun and angle to subject.  Thanks for squaring that horizon.  Glorious gradient to the dark blue sky.  I think this is a magnificent seascape.   And, great title.  This one has it all.   10', '2013-02-07 13:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974313, 1052739, 54446, '<td valign="top">This strikes an emotional chord with me, as my golden retriever loved the wind in her face as we drove down the road.  Superb b&amp;w.  Nice conversion.  I suppose it''s the curl of the ear on the far left which makes this magical.  Tolerant dog.  9</td>', 'This strikes an emotional chord with me, as my golden retriever loved the wind in her face as we drove down the road.  Superb b&w.  Nice conversion.  I suppose it''s the curl of the ear on the far left which makes this magical.  Tolerant dog.  9', '2013-02-07 13:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974331, 1052728, 54446, '<td valign="top">Mountaintop view.  Love the atmospherics below. Some color and contrast noise, but in general, good job considering the acute angle to the sun.  I like the clouds above as an added element of interest.  The nearly square format is a drawback, but that''s nitpicking.  9</td>', 'Mountaintop view.  Love the atmospherics below. Some color and contrast noise, but in general, good job considering the acute angle to the sun.  I like the clouds above as an added element of interest.  The nearly square format is a drawback, but that''s nitpicking.  9', '2013-02-07 13:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974332, 1052700, 54446, '<td valign="top">I especially like your asymmetrical composition.  Great subject.  Meets the challenge well.  Acute angle to the sun.  Would love to see a more natural looking sky that was less bright with more gradient, but maybe that''s the way the sky looks in your hemisphere.  Your choice of shutter speed to blur the windmill blades works great.   8</td>', 'I especially like your asymmetrical composition.  Great subject.  Meets the challenge well.  Acute angle to the sun.  Would love to see a more natural looking sky that was less bright with more gradient, but maybe that''s the way the sky looks in your hemisphere.  Your choice of shutter speed to blur the windmill blades works great.   8', '2013-02-07 13:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974333, 1052704, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a grand seascape with effective treatment of storm clouds overhead.  Magical light on the waves, beach and cliffs.  Wonderful detail.  Meets the challenge well.  Expert control of exposure.  My pick for the blue ribbon.  10</td>', 'Wow, this is a grand seascape with effective treatment of storm clouds overhead.  Magical light on the waves, beach and cliffs.  Wonderful detail.  Meets the challenge well.  Expert control of exposure.  My pick for the blue ribbon.  10', '2013-02-07 13:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974335, 1052749, 54446, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light and color.  Those streaming clouds indicate high winds overhead.  I love the contrast between the jet stream overhead and the perfect calm mirror at eye-level.  This meets the challenge well.  This is an image which would really benefit from a bigger pixel allowance.  Great job!  9</td>', 'Gorgeous light and color.  Those streaming clouds indicate high winds overhead.  I love the contrast between the jet stream overhead and the perfect calm mirror at eye-level.  This meets the challenge well.  This is an image which would really benefit from a bigger pixel allowance.  Great job!  9', '2013-02-07 13:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974338, 1052777, 54446, '<td valign="top">Ansel Adams-like.  Great conversion to b&amp;w.  The detail in the clouds is awesome.  Lots of air flow overhead.  Meets the challenge well.  Love the added elements of interest in the foreground.  8</td>', 'Ansel Adams-like.  Great conversion to b&w.  The detail in the clouds is awesome.  Lots of air flow overhead.  Meets the challenge well.  Love the added elements of interest in the foreground.  8', '2013-02-07 13:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974339, 1052804, 54446, '<td valign="top">Outstanding portrait.  Wind-blown hair and boa meet the challenge well.  Love your composition.  Pro treatment of black bg.  8</td>', 'Outstanding portrait.  Wind-blown hair and boa meet the challenge well.  Love your composition.  Pro treatment of black bg.  8', '2013-02-07 13:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974341, 1052786, 54446, '<td valign="top">The advantage of shooting into the direction of the sun is the halo effect on the hair of the child.  Meets the challenge. 7</td>', 'The advantage of shooting into the direction of the sun is the halo effect on the hair of the child.  Meets the challenge. 7', '2013-02-07 13:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974345, 1052767, 54446, '<td valign="top">Elegant and classy.  Love the twirly.  Outstanding composition.  7</td>', 'Elegant and classy.  Love the twirly.  Outstanding composition.  7', '2013-02-07 13:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974346, 1052739, 16148, '<td valign="top">handsome!  Very well done.</td>', 'handsome!  Very well done.', '2013-02-07 13:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974347, 1052703, 16148, '<td valign="top">Your exposure/processing adds to the story.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Your exposure/processing adds to the story.  Nicely done.', '2013-02-07 13:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974349, 1052631, 54446, '<td valign="top">The sea foam definitely indicates a wind event in progress.  Good freeze of the action.  Some blocked up shadows and some detail lost in the brightest clouds.  Overall, nice job.</td>', 'The sea foam definitely indicates a wind event in progress.  Good freeze of the action.  Some blocked up shadows and some detail lost in the brightest clouds.  Overall, nice job.', '2013-02-07 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974351, 1052610, 54446, '<td valign="top">I''ll guess Hermit Thrush, <i>Catharus guttatus</i>.  But, it could be one of several thrushes.  I like the wind blown feathers.  Good job on the b&amp;w conversion.  Pretty good detail throughout.  Sharpness does vary some from here to there.  7</td>', 'I''ll guess Hermit Thrush, Catharus guttatus.  But, it could be one of several thrushes.  I like the wind blown feathers.  Good job on the b&w conversion.  Pretty good detail throughout.  Sharpness does vary some from here to there.  7', '2013-02-07 13:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974353, 1052788, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like the toning.  The plant material flying in the air is a good element of interest.  Meets the challenge well.</td>', 'I like the toning.  The plant material flying in the air is a good element of interest.  Meets the challenge well.', '2013-02-07 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974354, 1052363, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful toning on this image.  A slight breeze qualifies as much as a gale.  Elegant and graceful.  7</td>', 'Wonderful toning on this image.  A slight breeze qualifies as much as a gale.  Elegant and graceful.  7', '2013-02-07 13:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974355, 1052777, 16148, '<td valign="top">Interesting how you lined up the horizon and top rung of barbed wire.  Doesn''t get in the way and adds some interest.  Very nice!</td>', 'Interesting how you lined up the horizon and top rung of barbed wire.  Doesn''t get in the way and adds some interest.  Very nice!', '2013-02-07 13:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974356, 1052782, 54446, '<td valign="top">Turkey vulture flying over a city.  They do soar on the wind currents.  More like wobble because they have a fairly big wingspan relative to body weight.  Meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Turkey vulture flying over a city.  They do soar on the wind currents.  More like wobble because they have a fairly big wingspan relative to body weight.  Meets the challenge well.', '2013-02-07 13:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974357, 1052775, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wind blown hair for sure.  Nice expression and smile.  Pretty portrait and lighting.</td>', 'Wind blown hair for sure.  Nice expression and smile.  Pretty portrait and lighting.', '2013-02-07 13:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974362, 1052731, 54446, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well.   The postprocessing generated some halo artifacts, especially around each large branch.  The look takes on sort of an old style HDR appearance.  That''s a drawback.  But then, I prefer a more natural look.  Okay image.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well.   The postprocessing generated some halo artifacts, especially around each large branch.  The look takes on sort of an old style HDR appearance.  That''s a drawback.  But then, I prefer a more natural look.  Okay image.', '2013-02-07 13:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974372, 1052696, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful flag trees.  Very clear which way the wind blows and how hard it blows... because the trees have been shaped to the environmental conditions.  Meets the challenge well.  Great exposure.  I might have found a place without the distractions of the stop lights and fence and main road.  Otherwise, I like it.</td>', 'Wonderful flag trees.  Very clear which way the wind blows and how hard it blows... because the trees have been shaped to the environmental conditions.  Meets the challenge well.  Great exposure.  I might have found a place without the distractions of the stop lights and fence and main road.  Otherwise, I like it.', '2013-02-07 14:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974373, 1052812, 54446, '<td valign="top">A fashion shoot with fans to make the hair flow.  Very pretty.  Nice toning.</td>', 'A fashion shoot with fans to make the hair flow.  Very pretty.  Nice toning.', '2013-02-07 14:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974379, 1052699, 54446, '<td valign="top">Lots of wind evidence in this photo.  It''s clear from which direction the tropical storms approach.  I''m mixed on the benefit of the birds in the scene.  They are flying against the wind, so it''s okay.</td>', 'Lots of wind evidence in this photo.  It''s clear from which direction the tropical storms approach.  I''m mixed on the benefit of the birds in the scene.  They are flying against the wind, so it''s okay.', '2013-02-07 14:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974383, 1052759, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful flock of sheep .  I see the big snowdrift to the left... so in effect the stone fence acts as a snow fence.  Powerful winds in evidence.  I''d like the image a lot more if the horizon tilt were not a distraction.  Still, this tells a magnificent story of domestic animal adversity in winter.  7</td>', 'Wonderful flock of sheep .  I see the big snowdrift to the left... so in effect the stone fence acts as a snow fence.  Powerful winds in evidence.  I''d like the image a lot more if the horizon tilt were not a distraction.  Still, this tells a magnificent story of domestic animal adversity in winter.  7', '2013-02-07 14:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974384, 1052657, 54446, '<td valign="top">A breeze evident in the flame distortion.  Good detail.  The reflections at the base of the candles is slightly distracting.  Otherwise, meets the challenge well.</td>', 'A breeze evident in the flame distortion.  Good detail.  The reflections at the base of the candles is slightly distracting.  Otherwise, meets the challenge well.', '2013-02-07 14:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974387, 1052160, 54446, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  I like the varying lengths of snow flake movement in the foreground.  Not sure about the texture in the background.  I''m not saying it''s not snow.  I just don''t know I prefer it over a dark bg.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  I like the varying lengths of snow flake movement in the foreground.  Not sure about the texture in the background.  I''m not saying it''s not snow.  I just don''t know I prefer it over a dark bg.', '2013-02-07 14:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974389, 1052545, 54446, '<td valign="top">Those horsetail and popcorn clouds are indicative of high altitude winds.  I might have excluded the sun.</td>', 'Those horsetail and popcorn clouds are indicative of high altitude winds.  I might have excluded the sun.', '2013-02-07 14:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974392, 1052437, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good b&amp;w conversion.  Nice translucent wave frozen in action.  The bench and the bricks are my least fav parts of the scene.  The wave splash against the stormy sky is my favorite part.</td>', 'Good b&w conversion.  Nice translucent wave frozen in action.  The bench and the bricks are my least fav parts of the scene.  The wave splash against the stormy sky is my favorite part.', '2013-02-07 14:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974395, 1052627, 54446, '<td valign="top">Creative job of selective saturation.  I see some blur in the vegetations, so it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Creative job of selective saturation.  I see some blur in the vegetations, so it meets the challenge.', '2013-02-07 14:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974396, 1051902, 54446, '<td valign="top">Not easy to do.  I''d like to have seen more detail in the drift, but the snow is frozen in motion.  Good to have the dark trees in the background to accentuate the contrast.</td>', 'Not easy to do.  I''d like to have seen more detail in the drift, but the snow is frozen in motion.  Good to have the dark trees in the background to accentuate the contrast.', '2013-02-07 14:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974398, 1052661, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Meets the challenge well.  Stylish image.</td>', 'Very nice.  Meets the challenge well.  Stylish image.', '2013-02-07 14:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974401, 1052778, 54446, '<td valign="top">Long-tailed Ducks!!!!  <i>Clangula hyemalis</i>  Really a great shot of this wonderful bird.  I''ve never seen this bird, so I am very jealous.  And, you have a flock foraging in the windblown surf with ocean spray across the top of the cresting wave.  Amazing.  Hope this is appreciated by others as much as I like it.  10</td>', 'Long-tailed Ducks!!!!  Clangula hyemalis  Really a great shot of this wonderful bird.  I''ve never seen this bird, so I am very jealous.  And, you have a flock foraging in the windblown surf with ocean spray across the top of the cresting wave.  Amazing.  Hope this is appreciated by others as much as I like it.  10', '2013-02-07 14:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974405, 1052756, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good one to show the snow falling with the wind.  Snow temp under gray skies is tough to get right.  This is a bit gray to me, as in underexposed.  Otherwise, I like the interesting things in the scene.</td>', 'Good one to show the snow falling with the wind.  Snow temp under gray skies is tough to get right.  This is a bit gray to me, as in underexposed.  Otherwise, I like the interesting things in the scene.', '2013-02-07 14:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974406, 1052801, 54446, '<td valign="top">Yikes.  That''s a lot of windblown lavender hair.  Good glamour portrait with effective white bg.</td>', 'Yikes.  That''s a lot of windblown lavender hair.  Good glamour portrait with effective white bg.', '2013-02-07 14:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974407, 1052603, 54446, '<td valign="top">There is some posterization in the sky.  Probably from jpg compression.  I think this meets the challenge okay.  It''s all about waiting for the imminent wind.</td>', 'There is some posterization in the sky.  Probably from jpg compression.  I think this meets the challenge okay.  It''s all about waiting for the imminent wind.', '2013-02-07 14:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974408, 1052805, 54446, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well.  I think this image needs another element of interest.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well.  I think this image needs another element of interest.', '2013-02-07 14:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974409, 1052393, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like the sky okay.  The clouds indicate wind in the atmosphere.  Probably too much asphalt street for me.  The fisheye effect of the lens is a distraction at the edges.</td>', 'I like the sky okay.  The clouds indicate wind in the atmosphere.  Probably too much asphalt street for me.  The fisheye effect of the lens is a distraction at the edges.', '2013-02-07 14:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974410, 1052571, 54446, '<td valign="top">Cool image.  Beautiful sky gradient.  Creative presentation.  Meets the challenge well. 8</td>', 'Cool image.  Beautiful sky gradient.  Creative presentation.  Meets the challenge well. 8', '2013-02-07 14:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974411, 1052814, 54446, '<td valign="top">I can hear the sound of the wings of these Canada geese.  Your shutter speed was a good compromise between wing blur (wind indication) and bird motion.  It''s a nice nature scene.</td>', 'I can hear the sound of the wings of these Canada geese.  Your shutter speed was a good compromise between wing blur (wind indication) and bird motion.  It''s a nice nature scene.', '2013-02-07 14:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974413, 1052810, 54446, '<td valign="top">Sheer curtains moving in the breeze.  Creative presentation.  Effective natural lighting.  Maybe a touch too much creative glamour glow, but that''s probably just me.</td>', 'Sheer curtains moving in the breeze.  Creative presentation.  Effective natural lighting.  Maybe a touch too much creative glamour glow, but that''s probably just me.', '2013-02-07 15:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974414, 1052733, 54446, '<td valign="top">I see that it''s windy from the motion blur of the tree branches.  This would have been more effective if the building had been sharply in focus.  Sort of looks like some camera shake.  The flag on the far left seems to be motionless, but could have just been a moment of pause.</td>', 'I see that it''s windy from the motion blur of the tree branches.  This would have been more effective if the building had been sharply in focus.  Sort of looks like some camera shake.  The flag on the far left seems to be motionless, but could have just been a moment of pause.', '2013-02-07 15:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974415, 1052806, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good clarity on the foreground people.  The wind blown hair is a good indication of the breeze.  It would have been nice to see more of the faces and eyes.</td>', 'Good clarity on the foreground people.  The wind blown hair is a good indication of the breeze.  It would have been nice to see more of the faces and eyes.', '2013-02-07 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974418, 1052776, 54446, '<td valign="top">Lens flare adds some color, but I think it may have caused some flat contrast on the right and middle.  Strands of hair blowing in the breeze.  Meets the challenge.</td>', 'Lens flare adds some color, but I think it may have caused some flat contrast on the right and middle.  Strands of hair blowing in the breeze.  Meets the challenge.', '2013-02-07 15:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974420, 1052628, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty hair blown by the wind.  Good freeze of the action.</td>', 'Pretty hair blown by the wind.  Good freeze of the action.', '2013-02-07 15:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974422, 1051954, 54446, '<td valign="top">Sort of distant, but you put the skier and his kite in the same photo.  Lots of angry surf.</td>', 'Sort of distant, but you put the skier and his kite in the same photo.  Lots of angry surf.', '2013-02-07 15:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974423, 1052632, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.  Very creative.  Meets the challenge well. 8</td>', 'Nice effect.  Very creative.  Meets the challenge well. 8', '2013-02-07 15:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974426, 1052709, 54446, '<td valign="top">I''ll guess Ring-billed Gull, <i>Larus delawarensis</i>.  The breast feathers appear slightly blown out , but they are in the sunshine.  I see the ruffled feathers.  Meets the challenge.</td>', 'I''ll guess Ring-billed Gull, Larus delawarensis.  The breast feathers appear slightly blown out , but they are in the sunshine.  I see the ruffled feathers.  Meets the challenge.', '2013-02-07 15:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974427, 1052772, 54446, '<td valign="top">Visibility always drops when snow is blowing in the air.    Good shot of the slope.</td>', 'Visibility always drops when snow is blowing in the air.    Good shot of the slope.', '2013-02-07 15:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974428, 1052755, 54446, '<td valign="top">Hope you kept your gear dry.  Lots of spray and surf.  Meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Hope you kept your gear dry.  Lots of spray and surf.  Meets the challenge well.', '2013-02-07 15:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974431, 1052748, 54446, '<td valign="top">Superb.  I especially like the marks in the sand from the plants left blowing in the wind.   I also like the patch of blue sky with clouds above.  The brown sand with great texture is a complement to the winter blue sky.  9</td>', 'Superb.  I especially like the marks in the sand from the plants left blowing in the wind.   I also like the patch of blue sky with clouds above.  The brown sand with great texture is a complement to the winter blue sky.  9', '2013-02-07 15:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974432, 1052717, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  Pleasant b&amp;w image.  Good conversion.  The motion blur of the plants is an interesting contrast to the hills and beach below.  8</td>', 'I like this a lot.  Pleasant b&w image.  Good conversion.  The motion blur of the plants is an interesting contrast to the hills and beach below.  8', '2013-02-07 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974433, 1052813, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good exposure of a couple minutes.  The industrial smokestacks are a nice contrast against the star trails.</td>', 'Good exposure of a couple minutes.  The industrial smokestacks are a nice contrast against the star trails.', '2013-02-07 15:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974434, 1052803, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good flag shot.  I like the composition.  The tree branches provide a cluttered, and therefore distracting, background.</td>', 'Good flag shot.  I like the composition.  The tree branches provide a cluttered, and therefore distracting, background.', '2013-02-07 15:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974437, 1052800, 54446, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the id, but I''ll guess an immature Franklin''s Gull, <i>Leucophaeus pipixcan</i>.  Very nice feathers blown by the wind.  Excellent clarity and feather detail.  9</td>', 'Not sure about the id, but I''ll guess an immature Franklin''s Gull, Leucophaeus pipixcan.  Very nice feathers blown by the wind.  Excellent clarity and feather detail.  9', '2013-02-07 15:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974438, 1052330, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the newspapers blowing past.  Meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Good capture of the newspapers blowing past.  Meets the challenge well.', '2013-02-07 15:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974441, 1052377, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness to the silhouettes.  I like the crepuscular rays, too.</td>', 'Good sharpness to the silhouettes.  I like the crepuscular rays, too.', '2013-02-07 15:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974442, 1052355, 54446, '<td valign="top">Can''t see much.  Guess you couldn''t see much of the house through the wind driven snow.</td>', 'Can''t see much.  Guess you couldn''t see much of the house through the wind driven snow.', '2013-02-07 15:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974443, 1051945, 54446, '<td valign="top">She seems distracted irritated by the photographer.  Looks like the wind might be blown back her hair, so it meets the challenge.  I don''t much like the blur vignette, but it does throw attention to the subject.</td>', 'She seems distracted irritated by the photographer.  Looks like the wind might be blown back her hair, so it meets the challenge.  I don''t much like the blur vignette, but it does throw attention to the subject.', '2013-02-07 15:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974444, 1052697, 54446, '<td valign="top">Really flapping in the wind, aren''t they.  Was the pole being moved in the wind, too.  Might have been more effective to have something in the scene static, so we could be grounded in the scene.</td>', 'Really flapping in the wind, aren''t they.  Was the pole being moved in the wind, too.  Might have been more effective to have something in the scene static, so we could be grounded in the scene.', '2013-02-07 15:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974446, 1052742, 54446, '<td valign="top">Somber image.  As I study the image, I see the American flag being whipped around.  Almost invisible and ghost-like, but I see it.</td>', 'Somber image.  As I study the image, I see the American flag being whipped around.  Almost invisible and ghost-like, but I see it.', '2013-02-07 15:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974447, 1052624, 54446, '<td valign="top">The sky is a problem for me, because it is not a natural gradient, or a solid color.  Looks like some areas have been dodged and other areas burned.  Pretty red color and good flag detail.</td>', 'The sky is a problem for me, because it is not a natural gradient, or a solid color.  Looks like some areas have been dodged and other areas burned.  Pretty red color and good flag detail.', '2013-02-07 15:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974450, 1052711, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good detail.  The wind is blowing the hair from left to right.</td>', 'Good detail.  The wind is blowing the hair from left to right.', '2013-02-07 15:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974453, 1052703, 54446, '<td valign="top">Creative and artistic presentation/treatment.  The old man is bracing against the wind and holding his hat.  Meets the challenge.</td>', 'Creative and artistic presentation/treatment.  The old man is bracing against the wind and holding his hat.  Meets the challenge.', '2013-02-07 15:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974455, 1051744, 54446, '<td valign="top">Needs more elements of interest.</td>', 'Needs more elements of interest.', '2013-02-07 15:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974456, 1052135, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good colors.  Motion blur and maybe camera shake.  Good subject.  Running like the wind.</td>', 'Good colors.  Motion blur and maybe camera shake.  Good subject.  Running like the wind.', '2013-02-07 15:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974457, 1052536, 54446, '<td valign="top">The wind is blowing the hair.  Not sure I like the yellow toning.  The eyes are closed by the wind, too.</td>', 'The wind is blowing the hair.  Not sure I like the yellow toning.  The eyes are closed by the wind, too.', '2013-02-07 15:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974458, 1052735, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good set up shot.  Really cute!</td>', 'Good set up shot.  Really cute!', '2013-02-07 15:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974462, 1052726, 54446, '<td valign="top">Creative and artistic.  Effective use of del desat, if that''s what it is.  The green translucent material is wonderul.  The person in full silhouette works, too.  7</td>', 'Creative and artistic.  Effective use of del desat, if that''s what it is.  The green translucent material is wonderul.  The person in full silhouette works, too.  7', '2013-02-07 15:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974465, 1052635, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great sport shot.  I wish we could see the person''s face, but I like the image fine.  Meets the challenge.  7</td>', 'Great sport shot.  I wish we could see the person''s face, but I like the image fine.  Meets the challenge.  7', '2013-02-07 15:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974481, 1052626, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good freeze of the action with the ruffled feathers from the breeze.  Outstanding clarity.  Great b&amp;w conversion.  8<br/> <br/>eta:  I can''t really see the beak color, but this might be a California Gull, <i>Larus californicus.</i></td>', 'Good freeze of the action with the ruffled feathers from the breeze.  Outstanding clarity.  Great b&w conversion.  8 eta:  I can''t really see the beak color, but this might be a California Gull, Larus californicus.', '2013-02-07 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
