(6975952, 1052363, 103032, '<td valign="top">Something about the processing of the background throws me off; would have liked to not have the branches on the right sticking into the frame.<br/> <br/>With that said, I like the indication of a breeze with the scarf(?) blowing.  Lovely model and impish pose; maybe not an imp, but a pixie...  Overall has a fantasy feel to the image.</td>', 'Something about the processing of the background throws me off; would have liked to not have the branches on the right sticking into the frame. With that said, I like the indication of a breeze with the scarf(?) blowing.  Lovely model and impish pose; maybe not an imp, but a pixie...  Overall has a fantasy feel to the image.', '2013-02-09 03:51:57.000000', NULL, 1);
