(6977426, 1052759, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love this - probably my favorite capture of the challenge but I just don''t understand why the horizon is tilted.   Unless you are trying to say it was so windy you couldn''t even hold the camera straight?  If that''s the case, I don''t think you needed to convince me.  9</td>', 'I love this - probably my favorite capture of the challenge but I just don''t understand why the horizon is tilted.   Unless you are trying to say it was so windy you couldn''t even hold the camera straight?  If that''s the case, I don''t think you needed to convince me.  9', '2013-02-11 17:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
