(6978159, 1052759, 137576, '<td valign="top">Haha my little rant was feb 7th day 1 of the challenge it does seem seem dpc voters are very concerned with horizons, do hills not exists in other areas. Especially given the fact they are hill sheap, the dry stone walls the depth of snow etc all point to a hill. I rushed this as I was late and not sure why the purple came in when I saved for web ill upload bigger one. <br/> <br/>Was a cold cold day blowing 50 to 60 mph :) 1dx and sigma 120-300 2.8</td>', 'Haha my little rant was feb 7th day 1 of the challenge it does seem seem dpc voters are very concerned with horizons, do hills not exists in other areas. Especially given the fact they are hill sheap, the dry stone walls the depth of snow etc all point to a hill. I rushed this as I was late and not sure why the purple came in when I saved for web ill upload bigger one.  Was a cold cold day blowing 50 to 60 mph :) 1dx and sigma 120-300 2.8', '2013-02-13 01:37:55.000000', NULL, 0),
