(6978302, 1052759, 100393, '<td valign="top">I think your purple problem is to do with the bad colour handling in most browsers. I bet you are editing with a wide colour gamut monitor. You won''t see it until you look with a browser. It happened with me when I used SFW in Photoshop without checking the ''embed colour profile'' box.<br/> <br/>(It was a 10 from me by the way)</td>', 'I think your purple problem is to do with the bad colour handling in most browsers. I bet you are editing with a wide colour gamut monitor. You won''t see it until you look with a browser. It happened with me when I used SFW in Photoshop without checking the ''embed colour profile'' box. (It was a 10 from me by the way)', '2013-02-13 05:29:33.000000', NULL, 0),
