(6978834, 1052739, 141319, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon. Great shot, no absolutely fantastic shot.<br/>I don''t want to be rude, but only a hound would actually sit still in front of a leaf blower ;-)</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon. Great shot, no absolutely fantastic shot.I don''t want to be rude, but only a hound would actually sit still in front of a leaf blower ;-)', '2013-02-13 16:54:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6978857, 1051902, 137576, '<td valign="top">8 from me was great shot, i was out in the snow as well capturing the howling wind, i had my thermal boiler suit on though :)</td>', '8 from me was great shot, i was out in the snow as well capturing the howling wind, i had my thermal boiler suit on though :)', '2013-02-13 17:36:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6978860, 1052160, 19825, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the PH Blue and a captivating image. I hope you enter more challenges. You have an intriguing eye. Give it some practice.</td>', 'Congratulations on the PH Blue and a captivating image. I hope you enter more challenges. You have an intriguing eye. Give it some practice.', '2013-02-13 17:49:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6978891, 1052571, 30861, '<td valign="top">I THOUGHT I had recognized her, LOL. Strange green flesh tones, but I assume that was intentional?</td>', 'I THOUGHT I had recognized her, LOL. Strange green flesh tones, but I assume that was intentional?', '2013-02-13 18:45:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6978927, 1052631, 114285, '<td valign="top">How is this, that this is only 5.45 when it shows more sign of wind than a few on the front page, lol!!</td>', 'How is this, that this is only 5.45 when it shows more sign of wind than a few on the front page, lol!!', '2013-02-13 19:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6978928, 1052571, 30791, '<td valign="top">@ Bear_Music<br/>I wasn''t too pleased with the color of the sky at the time of shooting so I did a white balance shift in camera to somewhere very blue then put a yellow gel over my light. Didn''t notice my mistake till I got into post, I should have grabbed an orange gel in retrospect <br/> <br/>@ Venser <br/>Ha, well if it wasn''t me it would be someone else that would have beaten you to the punch, I got that back when gmail was still invite-only out so I was very fortunate. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments everyone! It was fun to participate in a challenge again, it had been a while.</td>', '@ Bear_MusicI wasn''t too pleased with the color of the sky at the time of shooting so I did a white balance shift in camera to somewhere very blue then put a yellow gel over my light. Didn''t notice my mistake till I got into post, I should have grabbed an orange gel in retrospect  @ Venser Ha, well if it wasn''t me it would be someone else that would have beaten you to the punch, I got that back when gmail was still invite-only out so I was very fortunate.  Thanks for the comments everyone! It was fun to participate in a challenge again, it had been a while.', '2013-02-13 19:42:48.000000', NULL, 0),
